OL,3,GNEWSAUnseen photo of pioneering pilot
OL,4,Adiscovered
OL,5,
OL,6,FA photographer says he believes he has
OL,7,Funcovered a previously unseen picture
OL,8,Fof the pioneering pilot Amy Johnson.
OL,10,FMatthew Lamb from Hull says he thinks
OL,11,Fthe photograph shows Johnson sitting in
OL,12,Fa Cirrus II Moth plane alongside her
OL,13,Fflying instructor, Captain Valentine
OL,14,FBaker, during the first few months of
OL,15,Fher flying lessons in the late 1920s.
OL,17,FLamb bought the photograph as part of a
OL,18,Fcollection and has donated a copy to
OL,19,FSewerby Hall and Gardens, near
OL,20,FBridlington, to feature in its Amy
OL,21,FJohnson memorabilia collection.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
